+     *   running a test, and hasFinished() reads any non-zero exit as a kill. See #313.
+     * - On every platform, the joined pattern passes PCRE's compiled-size limit. PHPUnit wraps
+     *   the filter as `/<filter>/i`; when that does not compile it matches no test name, so the
+     *   child prints "No tests found.", exits 0, and is scored untested. See #408.
+     *
